source 2007 Feng--Wu, second JQN2 doubling formula, plus substitution epsilon=1, plus substitution delta=-a
appliesto 2xyz
parameter a2
assume a2 = 2*a
compute T1 = (X1*Z1)^2
compute T2 = Y1^2
compute S1 = (T2+2*c*T1)^2
compute U = (X1*Z1+Y1)^2-T1-T2
compute V = U^2
compute X3 = U
compute Y3 = S1-c*V
compute Z3 = T2-a2*T1-2*X1^4
